{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17152","headline":"石季伦金谷园 · 许尧佐","name":"石季伦金谷园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石氏遗文在，凄凉见故园。\n轻风思奏乐，衰草忆行轩。\n舞榭苍苔掩，歌台落叶繁。\n断云归旧壑，流水咽新源。\n曲沼残烟敛，丛篁宿鸟喧。\n唯余池上月，犹似对金尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许尧佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}